# 🚆 Train Delay Prediction – Indian Railways Case Study

## Overview
This project builds a **production-grade ML pipeline** to predict train delays in Indian Railways.  
It combines **classification** (Late vs. On-time) and **regression** (minutes late) using a dataset of **
over 1.5 million intelligently imputed records**.

What if you could predict train delays before they happen?
I built a production-ready ML pipeline trained on 1.5M+ intelligently imputed records from Indian Railways.

🔹 Dual Prediction:

Classification → Late vs. On-time

Regression → How many minutes late

🔹 Tech Stack:  
Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn, AutoViz, Colab




